==Russian==

===Etymology 1===
{{bor+|ru|cu|въсхытити||to [[fascinate]], to [[snatch]] [[away]]}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{ru-IPA|восхити́ть}}

====Verb====
{{ru-verb|восхити́ть|pf|impf=восхища́ть}}

# to [[enrapture]], to [[delight]], to [[ravish]]

=====Conjugation=====
{{ru-conj|pf|4bщ+p|восхити́ть}}

=====Derived terms=====
* {{l|ru|восхити́тельный}}
* {{l|ru|восхище́ние|g=n}}

===Etymology 2===
Possibly an independent borrowing of the same Old Church Slavonic word as above. See also {{m|ru|-хи́тить}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{ru-IPA|восхи́тить}}

====Verb====
{{ru-verb|восхи́тить|pf|impf=восхища́ть}}

# {{lb|ru|dated|high-style}} to [[lift up]]

=====Conjugation=====
{{ru-conj|pf|4aщ+p|восхи́тить}}
